  "title": "Scripps’ KRTV wins National Murrow Award for ‘Excellence in Innovation’",
  "summary": "Great Falls, Montana – KRTV, the CBS affiliate in Great Falls, Montana, owned by The E.W. Scripps Company (NASDAQ: SSP), has earned a 2026 National Edward R. Murrow Award in the category of “Excellence in Innovation” for its special report, “Milk River Meltdown.”",
